  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "purpose": "Binds the national sector taxonomy onto the Maps organization model that already exists in markets/organizations/industries.json and pockets.json. Nothing is duplicated: the existing pocket and industry ids stay as they are, and every one of them resolves into the national taxonomy so a company can carry either vocabulary without losing the other.",
